    summary_60s: 'CHM001 Practicals include sensitivity and graduation of measuring equipment, preparation of standard solutions and serial dilution, volumetric analysis (acid–base, redox and precipitation titrations), determination of percentage composition of iron, titrimetric analysis of mixtur',
